{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_14_level_main_14-14_beg",
  "groupId": "main_14",
  "stageId": "main_14-14",
  "title": "搶佔舷側區域",
  "storyCode": "14-16",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_14-14_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "0c4cf3cf9779387819a7768962d6f0334a9844258f6da120c383dd2a3d17b085",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我一直在想，你什麼時候才會來找我，凱爾希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可惜你來晚了點，錯過了最美妙的時刻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "那株最早破芽的花在昨晚枯萎死掉了，但你再看看現在的它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "還是充滿活力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我沒有看出和之前有任何區別。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "正是如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "它自枯萎中誕生，轉眼便如此茁壯——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "唉，要是你也能親眼看到這個誕生在源石上的奇蹟有多好……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "這片自源石上誕生的花圃，凝聚了特蕾西婭太多的心血。\n除戰爭以外，特蕾西婭為薩卡茲所探尋到的另一條道路近在眼前。\n可這條路的未來到底通向哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "帶博士來看過這片花圃之後，你就開始花更多時間在這裡停留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "巴別塔還有很多事等著你這位議長處理，但連今天的全體會議你都缺席了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "現在不光有凱爾希醫生在，還有博士能幫忙，我偶爾稍稍偷懶算不上什麼大事，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我了解你，特蕾西婭。在大事上，你從不開玩笑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "凱爾希……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "博士有向你談起過自己的看法嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "沒有。我不知道你聽到了些什麼，但想必博士並沒有完全支持你的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我不會放棄，凱爾希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果這就是解決如今薩卡茲困境的辦法，我會去找特雷西斯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我會將這條路展示給所有的薩卡茲看，我們並非只有於仇恨中無盡輪迴這唯一的宿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "特蕾西婭——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "凱爾希，請先聽我說。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我很清楚這其中可能會隱藏著風險，但我相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果我在這條道路上走向不可控的未來，請拉住我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "特蕾西婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我知道你能做到，儘管你總是對許多事緘默不言。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "如果真想實現你所期待的那個未來，我們仍需要爭取博士的支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "在利用源石這件事上，博士……不可替代。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "但不論最後結果如何……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凱爾希",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "……我保證，那時我會在你身邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "（威脅的低吼）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "我拉住他了，別叫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "W",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "呵，我不會鬆手，你放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大風在你的耳邊呼嘯，你能透過破碎的舷窗看到下方的碎片大廈和滿目瘡痍的戰場。\n接連不斷的劇烈爆炸隨時都會將你甩出去，而現在拉住你的人……是W。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你很少見到如此嚴肅的W。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（焦急的低吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我在考慮一件很重要的事，Mon3tr，現在別惹我。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "雖然老女人不可靠，但她從不會拿你冒險。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "既然這麼危險的登艦任務她都堅持帶上你——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……想要見到殿下，想要停下這艘破船，一定用得上你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*。只能暫時放過你了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "上來吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……謝謝。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "剛才——",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "剛才什麼也沒有發生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "接下來怎麼走？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我還能聽到我背後炸彈的響聲。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "定位用的。你就當作爆炸是它的附加功能吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要是你也被卷走了，我總得找得到你才行——"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "對呀！當時怎麼忘了給老女人也上一個！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（不屑的低鳴）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "給你都是浪費，小怪物。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "趕快想想該怎麼走，空心罐頭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "剩下的時間不多，這破船眼看就要撞上外面那個怪東西……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要死也得見到殿下之後再死。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "在我們登艦之後，你一直很急躁。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哦？我都留你一命了，難道不是比平常更情緒穩定嗎？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……是因為要見到特蕾西婭了嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "我現在既要給老女人當保姆帶孩子，還要考慮怎麼弄掉那個核心。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "我沒工夫陪你玩問答遊戲。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……是因為擔心赫德雷和伊內絲嗎？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "嘁，他們有什麼好擔心的？"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "伊內絲對怎麼讓死人活過來已經很熟練了。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "她會處理好的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "……是因為第一次和我單獨相處嗎？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "……不要試圖挑釁我。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "如果不是現在，我可以保證你根本沒機會問這個問題。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "所以，不要再用一些自以為是的蠢問題來煩我——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "陰影從金屬中浮現，它們無處不在。\n死魂靈，無處不在。\n它已經來到了W的身前。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "船艙中的影子",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你也是薩卡茲！眾魂的憤怒，眾魂的怒吼，難道你能夠充耳不聞！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "船艙中的影子",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你不該——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "抱歉，手滑了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "對了，你剛想說什麼來著？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "等等，你不會是特意來告訴我殿下現在在哪吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "……\n……\n……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "金屬撕扯的聲音持續不斷，整艘飛空艇在怒號。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（緊張地把你的衣服鈎住）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "飛空艇……在發怒？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "死魂靈……在發怒？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "唔，看來它也不怎麼有理性嘛……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你能不能趁現在找到這艘破船上能量波動最明顯的地方？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那裡應該就是它的核心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……我不會這招。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（嘲笑地看著W）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……等等，我還有一個辦法。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "也許我能算出源石濃度變化最明顯的方位！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那就趕快！這怪傢伙的耐心顯然比我想的還要差！"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "它看上去可沒那麼懂禮貌，等著你算完……\n嘶……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喂，黑影怪，客人給你家送點禮，應該不過分吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "接住了！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "小怪物，要是你護不住他，老女人可一定會找你麻煩。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（高昂的吼叫）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這邊！但是牆體這麼厚，炸彈不可能穿透——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你是不是忘了這傢伙？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "按我以前的測試，它可不只是皮糙肉厚而已。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "抱緊它，博士！我給你們放個大煙火！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "爆炸的一瞬間，讓它護住你全力撞進去！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "聽懂了，小怪物？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（興奮的嘶吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那就準備好。三！二！一！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "“砰”！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我有點看不清——",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我的頭有點暈——",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "快……到……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我的耳朵好像有點……聽不清……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "嘿，{@nickname}，現在感覺怎麼樣？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "剛才又摸了一下牆壁，你們好像也不用非要如此精準地撞進爆炸點？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "讓你白白受苦真是抱歉。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（憤怒地揮手）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "小心點你的爪子，他的小身板可比不上你。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Mon3tr，我沒事，可以放我下來了……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你“臉色”看起來真差。呵，不用在我面前裝出這副樣子。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "這點小事，我可不信你扛不住。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我在擔心凱爾希……",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "我可不記得老女人有這麼脆弱，她——"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "……"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "（雖然已經不怎麼大喘氣了，但好像她的傷的確沒有痊癒……這小怪物還被送過來了……）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "（低落的鳴叫）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "別喊了，讓人心煩。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "你還能活蹦亂跳，老女人就不會有事……"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "如果阿米婭也遭遇了這些……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "聽伊內絲說，小兔子在諾伯特區已經對抗過一次這鬼東西。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "在怎麼對付這個怪東西上，她比我們都有經驗。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "哼，比起死魂靈，恐怕你落在我手上才讓她更擔心。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "（威脅的吼叫）"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "閉嘴，現在可沒老女人給你撐腰。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "W",
              "speakerId": null,
              "text": "小兔子不會有事，我說的。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "{@nickname}，別磨磨蹭蹭了，該走了——"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "W走在長廊上，不經意透過玻璃望向窗外，愣神了片刻。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "走吧，沒時間旅遊了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你來到了窗邊，看到了下方的戰場。\n諸王之息發出的金色光芒仍在天空閃爍，維多利亞的反攻此刻應該正在進行吧？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "維多利亞的反攻已經開始了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "希望羅德島的各位能夠幫上忙……",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "那下面現在就是地獄，不用看了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你剛剛……在為戰場悲傷？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……死的薩卡茲夠多了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "跟上。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "我有很多事，想要問問殿下。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（警惕地張望）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……Mon3tr？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（憤怒地攻擊地面）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "陰影的黑潮無聲無息地自你的腳下出現，以不可思議的速度將你拖入了走廊盡頭的黑暗中。\n你感受到一柄鋒利的刀刃已經抵上了你的後頸。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "這裡不止有死魂靈——！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（低沉的嘶吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "黑色的潮水將瘋狂掙扎的Mon3tr死死地包裹，讓其難以動彈。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "*薩卡茲粗口*，在我面前搶人！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Mon3tr",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "（憤怒的嘶吼）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "給我把人還回來！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你看到走廊盡頭的黑暗裡閃出了一道光亮，隨即傳來的便是一聲爆炸的轟鳴。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "從背後傳來的衝擊是如此強烈，以至於讓你狠狠地跌出黑暗，撞向地面。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "……好痛！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "……我背後的炸彈？！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "怎麼樣，能定位的新型推進裝置，還不錯吧？我都說過了，爆炸只是附加功能。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "不過讓你疼上兩三天還是能做到的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "哈，我們的配合還真是默契！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我沒同意過這種配合！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "你應該提前提醒我！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "要不要配合，怎麼配合，本來就是我說了算。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "喂，躲在裡面的人，是不是你也嚇了一跳？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "？？？",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你還是沒有什麼變化，W。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "——？"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你不能再往前了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "飛空艇的“幽靈”",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "還有你，“博士”。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "你……是活著的人。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "我應該見過你嗎？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "……"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她想起了自己回到巴別塔的那天。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "她想起了那扇破碎的大門，那個染血的標記……\n還有那些躲藏在面罩之下的……兇手。\n他們奪走了特蕾西婭的生命。\n那個特蕾西婭。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "W發現自己此刻無比冷靜。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "你一定會死。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "W",
          "speakerId": null,
          "text": "而且，會死得很慘。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
